  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You follow an opponent’s missed blow with a swift step out of the way.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sidestep<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you take a 5-foot step after an attack misses you in melee, you do not need to remain within your attacker’s threatened area. Alternatively, when attacked in melee you can use this feat to take a 5-foot step as an immediate action before the attack is resolved. You must remain within the target’s threatened area, but your sudden movement at the last moment grants you a dodge bonus to your AC against that attack equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum +1). You can use this ability more than once per round by expending one use of your mythic power per use after the first. Any movement you take while using this feat is deducted from your total movement on your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc77\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
